 =2(2+3t)^{7}\\cdot 3+{5}^{5+4t}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =6(2+3t)^{7}+{5}^{5+4t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can write the integral as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}F(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}6(2+3t)^{7}+{5}^{5+4t}\\,dt.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337240 13194139535202 true] [17592186337239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337241 13194139535202 true] [17592186337239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337242 13194139535202 true] [17592186337239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337243 13194139535202 true] [17592186337239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337244 13194139535202 true] [17592186337239 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535202 true] [17592186337239 1041 "selection" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337239 1104 #edb/ref 17592186337243 13194139535202 true] [17592186337239 1110 #uuid "cbc2fd45-07e9-5bd3-90b2-d89713a73939" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337240 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}3(2+3t)^{7}+4\\cdot {5}^{5+4t}\\,dt" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337240 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535202 true] [17592186337240 1111 #uuid "a6c158ee-dd34-5183-80ea-1f31735174c0" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337241 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}(2+3t)^{7}+{5}^{5+4t}\\,dt" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337241 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535202 true] [17592186337241 1111 #uuid "0b79a014-acf2-5f8a-ad71-974a5e98c40f" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337242 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}6(3t)^{7}+{5}^{4t}\\,dt" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337242 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535202 true] [17592186337242 1111 #uuid "486ed8fb-0a87-52fe-97f6-505103f1752b" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337243 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}6(2+3t)^{7}+{5}^{5+4t}\\,dt" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337243 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535202 true] [17592186337243 1111 #uuid "a93ba21f-a81e-5b99-afa6-11e330ab5783" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337244 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}4(5+4t)^{7}+3\\cdot {5}^{2+3t}\\,dt" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337244 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535202 true] [17592186337244 1111 #uuid "509e6ab5-20ac-54f3-bf91-2b37b89e7d94" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337245 1017 #edb/ref 17592186337246 13194139535202 true] [17592186337245 1089 "q-125049" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337245 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535202 true] [17592186337245 1100 "Evaluate ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r,$ where $F(x,y)=y\\,i+x\\,j$ and $C$ is the curve $\\operatorname{sin}⁡y=x-2$ traversed from the point $A(2,0)$ to the point $B(2,\\pi ).$" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337245 1113 #uuid "f4dada09-aabc-5091-a725-8e79233cd8fe" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337245 1145 "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r={\\int }_{a}^{b}F(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nFirst, we need to parameterize the curve. Making $x$ the subject of the equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡y=x-2\\,⟹\\,x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡y+2.\n$$\n\nSo, the parametrization of the curve is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(t) & =(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+2)\\,i+t\\,j,\\,0\\le t\\le \\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, along the curve $C,$ we have\n\n$$\nx=\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+2,\\,y=t.\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(t)) & =y\\,i+x\\,j \\\\  & =t\\,i+(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+2)\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing ${r}^{′}(t),$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+2)i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)j \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,i+j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t) & =(t\\,i+(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+2)\\,j)\\cdot (\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,i+j) \\\\  & =t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }F(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }(t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+2)\\,dt \\\\  & ={[t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+2t]}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =(\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi )+2\\pi )-0 \\\\  & =2\\pi \\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337246 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337247 13194139535202 true] [17592186337246 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337248 13194139535202 true] [17592186337246 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337249 13194139535202 true] [17592186337246 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337250 13194139535202 true] [17592186337246 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337251 13194139535202 true] [17592186337246 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535202 true] [17592186337246 1041 "selection" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337246 1104 #edb/ref 17592186337250 13194139535202 true] [17592186337246 1110 #uuid "2ee28a0b-51f8-5b4a-9f9e-ec0e5f62633a" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337247 1034 "4\\pi " 13194139535202 true] [17592186337247 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535202 true] [17592186337247 1111 #uuid "eddf7318-bcdc-544c-9366-2fa0ea099e35" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337248 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337248 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535202 true] [17592186337248 1111 #uuid "8a77048d-c0f3-5fc7-8bb8-950b61209321" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337249 1034 "2{\\pi }^{2}" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337249 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535202 true] [17592186337249 1111 #uuid "b192fff1-59d4-5461-9f75-32907119420a" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337250 1034 "2\\pi " 13194139535202 true] [17592186337250 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535202 true] [17592186337250 1111 #uuid "cfcca7d2-c3ab-5469-b077-100117be7e51" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337251 1034 "4{\\pi }^{2}" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337251 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535202 true] [17592186337251 1111 #uuid "d19c2323-4547-5e32-a4ea-2808da118247" 13194139535202 true] [17592186337252 1017 #edb/ref 17592186337253 13194139535202 true] [17592186337252 1089 "q-125052" 131941395